  "body": "Be captivated by an extraordinary private sanctuary where architectural drama, resort-style living, harbour views and effortless entertaining converge. Down a private driveway and hidden behind security gates on 1527m² of sun-drenched grounds, this magnificent 5-bedroom, 423m² limestone brick and cedar residence is worlds away from every day. \r\n\r\nThe expansive drive sweeps through manicured lawns to the striking residence with space for multiple cars, even a boat. Lawns roll up to mature native trees, creating a secluded natural haven, alive with birdsong. \r\n\r\nThere’s a touch of Hollywood glamour here. But this is no showpiece without soul. The consummate fun family retreat is designed, for living, laughter and unforgettable gatherings. Award-winning architectural designer Scott Fowler of Architektur has created an extraordinary sense of scale and connection with generous spaces flowing indoors and out. \r\n\r\nThe double height entry makes an unforgettable first impression, opening to a generous living environment. 3-car internal garaging also leads to a rumpus, one of 3 substantial living spaces. Wrapped in light and opening on 2 sides, it extends to the heated pool, deck and lawn. 3 children’s bedrooms all open to the deck beside a bathroom, the perfect arrangement for summer. \r\n\r\nUpstairs, the atmosphere shifts from playful to sophisticated. 2 further living spaces open to decks while a marble fireplace creates an irresistible winter escape. Beyond, an oak floored living area extends to a barbecue deck where harbour views, all-day sun and connection to the kitchen/dining/living space set the stage for entertaining. Storage is capacious in the kitchen with a concealed pantry. \r\n\r\n2 more bedrooms with bathrooms sit apart on this level. The sumptuous master suite cantilevers above the driveway, creating a portico below. It enjoys a fitted walk-in plus office and sliders invite summer breezes inside. \r\n\t\r\nThen there is the location. Wander to St Heliers village and beach for a coffee and swim, then return to your private world behind gates. More than a beautiful home, this is a lifestyle of freedom, glamour and effortless pleasure where life feels like an endless holiday. \r\n\r\nExperience it for yourself. Your private playground awaits.  Drive down for open homes. Massive parking awaits!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
